(end) + 1)):\n                values.append(chr(n))\n\n    return values", "calls": [], "called_by": ["expand_alphanumeric_pattern"], "confidence": 0.92, "purpose": "Expand an alphanumeric range (continuous or not) into a list.", "behavior_patterns": ["ACCUMULATE(string.split(',') loop -> vals end, raises forms.ValidationE...)"], "semantic_contract": {"purpose": "Expand an alphanumeric range (continuous or not) into a list.", "language": "python", "symbol_name": "parse_alphanumeric_range", "symbol_type": "function", "signature": "(string)", "bases": [], "class_attrs": {}, "raises": ["ValidationError"], "uses": [], "behavior_patterns": ["ACCUMULATE(string.split(',') loop -> vals end, raises forms.ValidationE...)"], "tier": 1, "calls": [], "called_by": [{"source": "symbol:netbox/utilities/forms/utils.py:expand_alphanumeric_pattern:96"}], "complexity_indicators": {"decorator_depth": 0, "generic_type_param_count": 0}}}
