{"node_id": "symbol:netbox/utilities/html.py:highlight:43", "symbol": "highlight", "type": "function", "file": "netbox/utilities/html.py", "lines": [43, 71], "source": "def highlight(value, highlight, trim_pre=None, trim_post=None, trim_placeholder='...'):\n    \"\"\"\n    Highlight a string within a string and optionally trim the pre/post portions of the original string.\n\n    Args:\n        value: The body of text being searched against\n        highlight: The string of compiled regex pattern to highlight in `value`\n        trim_pre: Maximum length of pre-highlight text to include\n        trim_post: Maximum length of post-highlight text to include\n        trim_placeholder: String value to swap in for trimmed pre/post text\n    \"\"\"\n    # Split value on highlight string\n    try:\n        if type(highlight) is re.Pattern:\n            pre, match, post = highlight.split(value, maxsplit=1)\n        else:\n            highlight = re.escape(highlight)\n            pre, match, post = re.split(fr'({highlight})', value, maxsplit=1, flags=re.IGNORECASE)\n    except ValueError:\n        # Match not found\n        return escape(value)\n\n    # Trim pre/post sections to length\n    if trim_pre and len(pre) > trim_pre:\n        pre = trim_placeholder + pre[-trim_pre:]\n    if trim_post and len(post) > trim_post:\n        post = post[:trim_post] + trim_placeholder\n\n    return f'{escape(pre)}<mark>{escape(match)}</mark>{escape(post)}'", "calls": [], "called_by": [], "confidence": 0.92, "purpose": "Highlight a string within a string and optionally trim the pre/post portions of the original string.", "behavior_patterns": [], "semantic_contract": {"purpose": "Highlight a string within a string and optionally trim the pre/post portions of the original string.", "language": "python", "symbol_name": "highlight", "symbol_type": "function", "signature": "(value, highlight, trim_pre, trim_post, trim_placeholder)", "bases": [], "class_attrs": {}, "raises": [], "uses": [], "behavi