{"node_id": "symbol:netbox/utilities/permissions.py:qs_filter_from_constraints:86", "symbol": "qs_filter_from_constraints", "type": "function", "file": "netbox/utilities/permissions.py", "lines": [86, 114], "source": "def qs_filter_from_constraints(constraints, tokens=None):\n    \"\"\"\n    Construct a Q filter object from an iterable of ObjectPermission constraints.\n\n    Args:\n        tokens: A dictionary mapping string tokens to be replaced with a value.\n    \"\"\"\n    if tokens is None:\n        tokens = {}\n\n    User = apps.get_model('users.User')\n    for token, value in tokens.items():\n        if token == CONSTRAINT_TOKEN_USER and isinstance(value, User):\n            tokens[token] = value.id\n\n    def _replace_tokens(value, tokens):\n        if type(value) is list:\n            return list(map(lambda v: tokens.get(v, v), value))\n        return tokens.get(value, value)\n\n    params = Q()\n    for constraint in constraints:\n        if constraint:\n            params |= Q(**{k: _replace_tokens(v, tokens) for k, v in constraint.items()})\n        else:\n            # Found null constraint; permit model-level access\n            return Q()\n\n    return params", "calls": ["_replace_tokens"], "called_by": [], "confidence": 0.92, "purpose": "Construct a Q filter object from an iterable of ObjectPermission constraints.", "behavior_patterns": ["ACCUMULATE(tokens.items() loop -> result)"], "semantic_contract": {"purpose": "Construct a Q filter object from an iterable of ObjectPermission constraints.", "language": "python", "symbol_name": "qs_filter_from_constraints", "symbol_type": "function", "signature": "(constraints, tokens)", "bases": [], "class_attrs": {}, "raises": [], "uses": ["Q (django.db.models)"], "behavior_patterns": ["ACCUMULATE(tokens.items() loop -> result)"], "tier": 1, "calls": [{"target": "symbol:netbox/utilities/permissions.py:qs_filter_from_constraints._replace_tokens:101", "is_external": false}], "called_by": [], "complexity_indicators